# FullBleed

Creates a centered 'tube of content' with options for elements to break the column
srpead out to the left and right.

Available classes for child elements are:

- `u-full-bleed--1`
- `u-full-bleed--2`
- `u-full-bleed--3`
- `u-full-bleed--4`
- `u-full-bleed--left`
- `u-full-bleed--left--2`
- `u-full-bleed--left--3`
- `u-full-bleed--left--4`
- `u-full-bleed--right`
- `u-full-bleed--right--2`
- `u-full-bleed--right--3`
- `u-full-bleed--right--4`

## Usage

```html
<div class="l-full-bleed">
	<span>Item</span>
	<span>Item</span>
	<span class="u-full-bleed--2">.u-full-bleed--2</span>
	...
</div>
```


